...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

front: "브라우저 쪽" {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 2
  user: 사용자 { class: person }
  ui: Streamlit UI (ai_financial_coach_agent.py) { class: ours }
}

coordinator: "재무 코디네이터 (FinanceCoordinatorAgent, SequentialAgent)" {
  class: group
  budget: 예산 분석 (BudgetAnalysisAgent) { class: ours }
  savings: 저축 전략 (SavingsStrategyAgent) { class: ours }
  debt: 부채 상환 (DebtReductionAgent) { class: ours }
}

gemini: Gemini API (gemini-2.5-flash) { class: ext }

front -> coordinator: 소득·지출·부채 JSON
coordinator -> gemini: 모델 호출 3회 (스키마 각각 다름)
coordinator -> front: 예산·저축·부채 JSON 3종
